🎥 Create and animate your very own Roblox movies using a growing library of characters, props, sceneries, effects, and sounds!

🍿 Publish your creations to our built-in search engine, then watch, rate, and review films made by other talented animators!

❗ Use "ShortsEntry" to the description of your movie if you'd like to have a chance of being featured on our channel! ❗

💬 This is a brand-new game, and we’re actively trying to improve it. If you find bugs or have suggestions, please let us know — your feedback really helps!

☺️ Finally, thank you for playing and supporting us! We truly appreciate our community and the continuous support. Can’t wait to see the movies you create! 🎬✨


